{"series":{"id":"a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2","slug":"a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2","title":"A Record of a Mortal’s Journey to Immortality","image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/A/A_Record_of_a_Mortals_Journey_to_Immortality_2/181dlhmken1_vz7furhd.jpg","synopsis":"Un pobre y ordinario chico de una aldea se une a una secta menor en Jiang Hu y se convierte en un Discípulo No Oficial por unas razones raras. ¿Cómo podrá Han Li, un plebeyo de nacimiento, establecerse en su secta? Con su aptitud mediocre, deberá atravesar exitosamente el traicionero camino de la cultivación y evadir la atención de aquellos que podrían hacerle daño. Esta es una historia de un mortal ordinario quién contra todos pelea , choca contra demonios diabólicos y celestiales antiguos para encontrar su propio camino hacia la Inmortalidad.","status":"En emisión","year":2017,"genres":["Acción","Artes Marciales","Aventura","Cultivación","Romance","Demonios","Fantasía","Historico","Lucha"],"type":"donghua","src":"mundodonghua","sourceUrls":["https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2","https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality","https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-5","https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-3"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-20T15:17:54.321Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2-t2","slug":"a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2-t2","seriesId":"a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2","number":2,"image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/A/A_Record_of_a_Mortals_Journey_to_Immortality_2/181dlhmken1_vz7furhd.jpg","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T15:17:54.321Z"},{"id":"a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2-t1","slug":"a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2-t1","seriesId":"a-record-of-a-mortals-journey-to-immortality-2","number":1,"image":